&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1996&quot; data-local-id=&quot;310e01a1-0776-44d8-be23-6fb20230f123&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of the modern Machine Learning stack, for example:&lt;br&gt;- Knowledge of contemporary transformer architectures, related concepts (e.g.,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;GQA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;-caching) and best practices&lt;br&gt;- Expertise in distributed training techniques&lt;br&gt;- Familiarity with optimisation strategies for model inference (e.g., dynamic batching, flash attention, speculative decoding)&lt;/p&gt;
