&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2360&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c336743-6b6e-4311-9a03-8015cd1f83ae&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python, ML frameworks (TensorFlow, PyTorch), and experience with cloud platforms&lt;/p&gt;
