&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2526&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4d35c374-49d0-484f-9b0b-2c7cf1a15602&quot;&gt;Strong familiarity with software engineering practices and ML testing frameworks&lt;/p&gt;
